      "lines": [
        "$S(x)\\Delta x\\leqslant\\Delta V\\leqslant S_{(x+\\Delta x)}\\cdot\\Delta x,$",
        "因此，$S(x)\\leqslant\\frac{\\Delta V}{\\Delta x}\\leqslant S_{(x+\\Delta x)}.$ （1）"
      ]
